    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Size\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><div><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hadozee Dodge\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">你血管中流淌的魔法增强了你的天生防御力。当你受到伤害时，你可以用反应投掷一枚d6。你受到的伤害减少 投掷结果+你的熟练加值 点（最低降至0） 。<br style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:medium;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;white-space:normal;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial\" />你能使用此特质次数等同于你的熟练加值，完成一次长休后，你重获全部已消耗的使用次数。</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><p>The magic that runs in your veins heightens your natural defenses. When you take damage, you can use your reaction to roll a [[/r d6]]. Add your proficiency bonus to the number rolled, and reduce the damage you take by an amount equal to that total (minimum of 0 damage).</p><p>You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus. You regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
